# Ducks swim in a line by day, and at night waddle onto the bank to sleep side by side.
set season summer
set clock day
set camera 34 24 2
fast 15 present duck 2
fast 10
expect habitat ok
shot shots/ducks_day.png
set clock night
fast 150 actor duck sleep
# Asleep on the bank, side by side (the last of the line comes ashore behind the others).
fast 90 bank duck
expect together duck 2
shot shots/ducks_night.png
quit
